# Mathlib notation. SYNTHETIC: written from Mathlib's notation declarations, not captured from a
# real Mathlib session (no Mathlib available locally yet). Re-check against real output later.

lean: ∀ ε > 0, ∃ δ > 0, ∀ (x : ℝ), |x - a| < δ → |f x - f a| < ε
tex: \forall \varepsilon > 0,\ \exists \delta > 0,\ \forall x \in \mathbb{R},\ \left|x - a\right| < \delta \to \left|f\left(x\right) - f\left(a\right)\right| < \varepsilon

lean: ∑ i ∈ Finset.range n, i = n * (n - 1) / 2
tex: \sum_{i=0}^{n - 1} i = \frac{n \cdot \left(n - 1\right)}{2}

lean: ∑ i ∈ Finset.range (n + 1), ↑i ^ 2
tex: \sum_{i=0}^{n} i^{2}

lean: ∏ i ∈ s, f i
tex: \prod_{i \in s} f\left(i\right)

lean: √2 * √2 = 2
tex: \sqrt{2} \cdot \sqrt{2} = 2

lean: Real.sqrt (x ^ 2) = |x|
tex: \sqrt{x^{2}} = \left|x\right|

lean: x⁻¹ * x = 1
tex: x^{-1} \cdot x = 1

lean: (n + 1)! = (n + 1) * n !
tex: \left(n + 1\right)! = \left(n + 1\right) \cdot n!

lean: ‖x + y‖ ≤ ‖x‖ + ‖y‖
tex: \left\|x + y\right\| \leq \left\|x\right\| + \left\|y\right\|

lean: ⌊x⌋ ≤ x
tex: \left\lfloor x\right\rfloor \leq x

lean: s ⊆ t ∪ u
tex: s \subseteq t \cup u

lean: s ∩ t = ∅
tex: s \cap t = \emptyset

lean: {x | x > 0} = Set.Ioi 0
tex: \left\{ x \mid x > 0 \right\} = \operatorname{Set.Ioi}\left(0\right)

lean: {x : ℝ | 0 < x}
tex: \left\{ x \in \mathbb{R} \mid 0 < x \right\}

lean: ∀ x ∈ Set.Icc 0 1, f x ≤ 1
tex: \forall x \in \operatorname{Set.Icc}\left(0, 1\right),\ f\left(x\right) \leq 1

lean: Real.exp (Real.log x) = x
tex: \exp \left(\log x\right) = x

lean: Real.sin x ^ 2 + Real.cos x ^ 2 = 1
tex: \left(\sin x\right)^{2} + \left(\cos x\right)^{2} = 1

lean: Nat.gcd a b ∣ a
tex: \gcd\left({a}, {b}\right) \mid a

lean: ℕ → ℝ
tex: \mathbb{N} \to \mathbb{R}

lean: (fun x ↦ x ^ 2) = fun x ↦ x * x
tex: \left(x \mapsto x^{2}\right) = x \mapsto x \cdot x

lean: a₁ + a₂ = n✝
tex: a_{1} + a_{2} = {n^{\dagger}}

lean: #s = 3
tex: \left|{s}\right| = 3

lean: (2 : ℝ) / 3 < 1
tex: \frac{2}{3} < 1

lean: Real.pi / 2 < 2
tex: \frac{\pi}{2} < 2

lean: ∫ x in 0..1, x ^ 2 = 1 / 3
tex: \texttt{$∫$ x in 0..1, x \textasciicircum{} 2 = 1 / 3}
